# Cursor Project Rules

This repository follows the **"Standards as Living Code"** framework defined in `AGENTS.md`.

*   **Read Before Writing**: Check `_agents/rules/holistic-reading.md` guidelines. Never replace code blindly without viewing the full file context.
*   **Zero-Warning Linter Policy**: Code must pass `npm run lint` / `npm test` cleanly (`_agents/rules/lint-and-fix.md`).
*   **Test Verification**: Follow the Red-Green-Refactor self-healing protocol (`_agents/rules/verification-loop.md`).
*   **Scope & Safety**: Do not add third-party dependencies or delete existing unrelated comments (`_agents/rules/safety-and-scope.md`).
